HB0094 Charter school authorizations-amendments.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Andrew, Bear, Bratten, Erickson,
Heiner, Kelly, Lawley, Lien, Neiman, Singh and Strock
and Senator(s) Biteman, Boner, Brennan, Crum, Olsen,
Scott and Steinmetz
AN ACT relating to education; removing a limitation on the number of charter
schools that the Wyoming charter school authorizing board may authorize; making
conforming amendments; and providing for an effective date.
12/30/2024 Bill Number Assigned
1/2/2025 H Received for Introduction
1/17/2025 H Introduced and Referred to H04 - Education
1/20/2025 H04 - Education:Recommend Do Pass 9-0-0-0-0
