Page 2-after line 5 Insert:
"(m) Not later than October 1, 2025, and each October 1 thereafter through
October 1, 2030, the Wyoming charter school authorizing board, in consultation
with the state superintendent of public instruction and the state construction
department, shall provide to the joint education interim committee, the joint
appropriations committee and the select committee on school facilities a report
identifying the fiscal impact on the public school foundation program account
and the education resource block grant model as defined by W.S.
21-13-101(a)(xiv) as a result of any charter school approved by the Wyoming
charter school authorizing board or approved by the state loan and investment
board that is supervised by the Wyoming charter school authorizing board. The
report shall specify the fiscal impact at the district and the school level and
shall at minimum identify the amounts generated under W.S. 21-3-314(c) and
amounts for facility needs, including but not limited to lease amounts,
expenditures or requests for major building and facility repair and replacement
under W.S. 21-15-109 and any other requests related to capital construction
projects.".
